B.asW=new A.i3(B.cx,"Atropine + neostigmine for neurotoxicity","For krait/cobra neurotoxicity: Atropine 0.05 mg/kg + Neostigmine 0.04 mg/kg IV. Reassess at 30 min \u2014 if improved, repeat neostigmine 0.04 mg/kg with atropine 0.025 mg/kg every 30 min \xd7 5 doses, then 1\u20132 hourly.",null)
